		"预算是字符不是字节：": "The budget counts characters, not bytes:", "entryBudget = 条目正文 + 分隔符（\\n§\\n 记 3 字符）。": "entryBudget = entry text + separators (\\n§\\n counts as 3 characters).",
		"中文一个字 3 字节，用 ls 的字节数看会误判成严重超限（实测 USER.md 磁盘 4745 字节 vs 预算 1921/2200）。": "A Chinese character uses 3 bytes. Using ls byte counts can make the file appear far over budget (USER.md: 4,745 bytes on disk vs. a 1,921/2,200 character budget).",
		"触发分级：": "Trigger levels:", "P1 显式请求 / P2 冷启动 / P2.5 恢复 / P3 首次场景 / P4 记忆阈值（累计新增记忆到阈值）。": "P1 explicit request / P2 cold start / P2.5 recovery / P3 first scene / P4 memory threshold (cumulative new memories reach the threshold).",
