		/* Pipeline */
		"流水线 · 队列与子代理": "Pipeline · Queue and subagents", "三层共用的作业队列（pipeline/jobs.sqlite）· 待消费触发信号 · 正在跑的子代理与停止。": "Shared job queue for all three layers (pipeline/jobs.sqlite) · pending trigger signals · running subagents and controls.",
		"说明": "Help", "队列：": "Queue:", "memoryDB/pipeline/jobs.sqlite 是三层共用的一条队列（主进程 worker 认领、子代理提交时自己标 done）。": "memoryDB/pipeline/jobs.sqlite is shared by all three layers. The main-process worker claims jobs; subagents mark them done when they submit.",
		"认领是单飞的 —— 任何时刻最多一条在跑，所以 queued 里排第一个的就是下一个。": "Claims are single-flight: at most one job runs at a time, so the first queued job is next.",
		"排队 已入队未认领 · 在跑 已认领（子进程在工作）· 完成 子代理提交成功 · 跳过 认领后门控不成立，没干活就收工（不是失败）· 失败 超时或异常，原因写在“说明”列。": "Queued: enqueued, not claimed · Running: claimed (child process working) · Completed: subagent submitted successfully · Skipped: a gate failed after claim, so the job stopped without running (not a failure) · Failed: timed out or errored; see Details.",
		"来源（谁把它排进来的）：": "Sources (what queued the job):", "周期到点 · 手动命令 · L1 提交（提交后自动排 L2）· 收尾续排（L1 收工时 L0 仍有积压）· 门控触发 / 显式信号（L3 的两条触发通道）。": "Scheduled · manual command · L1 submission (automatically queues L2) · follow-up after L1 (L0 still has backlog) · gated trigger / explicit signal (the two L3 trigger paths).",
		"请求入队": "Queue a request", "只写一份待消费信号，": "This writes a pending trigger signal only; ", "不是立即执行：": "it does not run the job immediately:",
		"需要 pi 会话活着，在下一轮结束（": "A pi session must be active. The main process consumes the signal when the next turn ends (", "）时由主进程消费；": ").", "pi 没开，信号就躺在盘上等。": "If pi is not running, the signal waits on disk.",
		"已有同层排队 / 在跑时，队列去重会让这次请求不新增任务。": "If a job for this layer is already queued or running, queue deduplication prevents another job from being added.",
