		"改写 / 删除 / 新增都落在 <code>USER-temp.md</code>（<b>提议稿</b>），<b>不会</b>立刻改变注入画像 —— ": "Edits, deletions, and additions are written to <code>USER-temp.md</code> (the <b>draft</b>) and do <b>not</b> immediately change the injected profile. ",
